    skos:broader cigars:Storage%20and%20Smoking ;
    skos:definition "Harmless small white powdery dots, from crystallized natural oils, that appear on an aging cigar's wrapper — a sign of proper aging; not to be confused with harmful blue/green mold." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://open-metadata.org/entity/glossary/2d4821f6-6d17-46e9-b5b6-b5af8b6068c0> ;
