        om:GlossaryTerm ;
    skos:broader cigars:Cigar%20Packaging ;
    skos:definition "A packaging style of 25 or 50 cigars in Spanish cedar boxes, bound with a ribbon inside; the extra air between cigars is believed to facilitate aging." ;
