        om:GlossaryTerm ;
    skos:broader cigars:Storage%20and%20Smoking ;
    skos:definition "A tool used to clip or open the cap of a cigar so air can pass; the three most common are the straight (guillotine), punch (bullet), and V (cat's eye) cutters." ;
